14 and attitude \u2014 prove crucial as the battle escalates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928320/extras/0d801a7c66923bf38b79f5614c4dc0fc.poster.avif?t=1769568665\" width=250 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928320/extras/0d801a7c66923bf38b79f5614c4dc0fc.webm?t=1769568665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928320/extras/50304da576e1d3d01d95c5b31857fc73.poster.avif?t=1769568665\" width=237 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928320/extras/50304da576e1d3d01d95c5b31857fc73.webm?t=1769568665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, they face the <strong>Corazones</strong>: people whose hearts have been twisted and overtaken by dark forces from beyond reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928320/extras/57147614a2d26b653fbca2398e7a6c87.poster.avif?t=1769568665\" width=250 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928320/extras/57147614a2d26b653fbca2398e7a6c87.webm?t=1769568665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928320/extras/ceb7452d6ad64044b91dacb7763238aa.poster.avif?t=1769568665\" width=21