"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928320/extras/7c50ee989e7cdafed35b86a7297cd2af.poster.avif?t=1769568665\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928320/extras/7c50ee989e7cdafed35b86a7297cd2af.webm?t=1769568665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928320/extras/7c50ee989e7cdafed35b86a7297cd2af.mp4?t=1769568665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb6 <strong>\u25bc GROOVE TO THE RHYTHM \u25bc</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter moves to the music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>fully dynamic soundtrack</strong> reacts to your in-game performance in real time, shifting and evolving as you shoot, dodge, and stay in sync. Inspired by an eclectic mix of genres \u2014 including <strong>Future Funk</strong>, <strong>New Jack Swing</strong>, and more \u2014 the soundtrack turns every battle into a living remix.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The better you play, the deeper the groove.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928320/extras/4fb787c3011c7bfb0f800249b8eee84d.avif?t=1769568665\" width=1138 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>PopSlinger</strong>, it\u2019s not just about shooting! It's about doing it with <strong>Style and Strategy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your Oranger to hit enemies with the <strong>matching color</strong> to keep the rhythm alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Land 4 shots of the same color</strong> to summon your<strong>\u00a0Popping Powers! Each color brings Gin out to assist you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928320/extras/b8baa98f1eaaaf38cd1e9098fc7a7efe.avif?t=1769568665\" width=724 height=330 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Pop 8 enemies in two matching sets</strong> to create a <strong>Color Progression!</strong> \u2014 this makes the <i>music change</i> instantly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928320/extras/342f5aeb06d0e0034f4a8b5e78f64c89.webp?t=1769568665\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928320/extras/342f5aeb06d0e0034f4a8b5e78f64c89.poster.avif?t=1769568665\" class=\"bb_img\" width=560 height=158 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep doing progressions to <strong>discover the whole track!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>8 of the same color leads to a Double Progression!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928320/extras/9d5622fd6ed9cb565c08cdba430617a8.webp?t=1769568665\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928320/extras/9d5622fd6ed9cb565c08cdba430617a8.poster.avif?t=1769568665\" class=\"bb_img\" width=560 height=158 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more combos you pull off, the more hype the music gets, and the higher rank you'll get! Get all you Rankmans!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928320/extras/b46f756f446b422c9cc402c389fd1358.avif?t=1769568665\" width=916 height=222 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete specific combo sequences to unlock Dream Time! A hyper mode where Ria becomes invincible!!\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928320/extras/0b95ad6ccc37a2d41d5f94ef9fb6d038.avif?t=1769568665\" width=898 height=289 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The best PopSlingers are smart and nimble! Their destinies are set during the party!!!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PopSlinger</strong> is a stylish, soda-powered musical adventure where rhythm fuels combat, emotion drives the story, and every shot pops to the beat.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd64 <strong>Developed by Funky Can Creative</strong></p>","developers":["Funky Can Creative"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928320/header.jpg?t=1769568665","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1928320/444544/43e4005d768e050ba5545b21fb2c8613260cc66d/1751049620/dash_av1.mpd?t=1647273691","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1928320/444544/43e4005d768e050ba5545b21fb2c8613260cc66d/1751049620/dash_h264.mpd?t=1647273691","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1928320/444544/43e4005d768e050ba5545b21fb2c8613260cc66d/1751049620/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1647273691","id":256876445,"name":"Announcement","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256876445/movie.293x165.jpg?t=164727369