rating_generated":"1","required_age":"6","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"14 Apr, 2022"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cFeels like a game that pays proper homage to the late \u201980s and early \u201990s with a VHS filter over the action, but with a bright look and higher level of detail in its world than even arcade games of the time.\u201d<br>4/5 \u2013 Hardcore Gamer<br><br>\u201cPopSlinger does just that [putting its best foot forward and leaving a lasting impression]. This arcade-style shoot\u2019em up is a bubbly, bright, and nostalgic surprise. I was drawn in by the retro anime aesthetics and dreamy city pop-inspired soundtrack...PopSlinger is a video game that wastes no time in putting the player right in the action.\u201d<br>Utopia District<br><br>\u201cPopSlinger is the perfect game for those times when you just want to kick back and have some plain, simple fun. Its whimsical and colorful visuals, amusing story, and easy-to-learn, difficult-to-master gameplay make it a charming and enjoyable experience that's sure to scratch that particular itch.\u201d<br>GoNintendo<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928320/ss_1091fa6e6292f50b1cb98ba4230a9cbea6a186cd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1769568665","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928320/ss_1091fa6e6292f50b1cb98ba4230a9cbea6a186cd.600x338.jpg?t=1769568665"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928320/ss_7f8222f93436fff22075a8e7eac31470a190f7c9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1769568665","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928320/ss_7f8222f93436fff22075a8e7eac31470a190f7c9.600x338.jpg?t=1769568665"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928320/ss_3ddd55b1407160629ab5a932ba0dc09f3929a477.1920x1080.jpg?t=1769568665","path_thumbnail":"ht